<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Fiserv estimates raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Fiserv estimates raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it raised its 1997 earnings estimate for Fiserv Inc to $1.70 a share from $1.60, and its estimate for 1998 to $2.02 from $1.91.</p>
<p>-- Yesterday, Fiserv announced plans to acquire BHC Financial Inc, a provider of securities processing and support services.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN said it also increased its price targets to $45 from $42 for six months and to $52 from $48 for 18 months.</p>
<p>-- Fiserv is a financial data processing and information management company.</p>
<p>-- Its shares were up 7/8 Tuesday at 37-1/2.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
